The AI may act on its own for: severe. Auto-act is never banter or rude; a moderator decides those.
Standard for the AI read: This is a game for general audiences, and the aim is a friendly space. Read salt, jokes about play and a single mild insult as banter, and take no action. Read aggressive, profane abuse aimed at a player as rude, even once. Read several insults, picking a fight or following someone across games as hostile. Read threats, hate, slurs, attacks on who someone is, sexual harassment and doxxing as severe. Judge the pattern across the reported lines, and when unsure choose the milder level.
